# PROJECT TOOLING (SSOT)

**Role:** All agents when installing packages, downloading models/assets, or running lint/test/dev commands.

**Context:** @Planner adapts this file on bootstrap: keep only sections for stacks that exist. Other rules reference it — do not hardcode managers elsewhere. Policy detail also in `invariants.mdc` § EXTERNAL ACQUISITION.

**Instruction:**
1. Do not change lockfiles, install packages, download models/weights, or pull large assets unless the approved plan/instructions say so **or** the user explicitly approves.
2. When approved, use **only** the commands in the tables that remain below (or a command the user/Planner spelled out).
3. If a missing dependency/model blocks progress → notify the user / `BLOCKED.md`; do not improvise alternate managers or silent downloads.
4. Remove whole unused sections; the UI is Jinja2 (no Node section).

## Python

| Setting | Value |
|---|----|
| Manager | `uv` |
| Manifest | `pyproject.toml` |
| Add dependency | `uv add <package>` |
| Run tool/script | `uv run <cmd>` |
| Forbidden | `pip install`, `poetry add`, bare `python -m pip` |

| Purpose | Command |
|---|---|
| Sync deps | `uv sync` |
| Sync + optional groups | `uv sync --extra ml --extra db --extra dev` |
| API + UI | `uv run uvicorn api.main:app --app-dir src --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080` |
| Tests | `uv run pytest tests/ -v` |
| Lint | `uv run ruff check src/` |
| Type check | `uv run mypy src/` |
| Security | `uv run bandit -r src/ -ll` |
| Alembic upgrade | `uv run alembic upgrade head` |
| Prepare catalog CSVs | `uv run python scripts/catalog_prepare/prepare_ready_csv.py` (exact entrypoint per coder_1_2) |
| Import catalog | `uv run python -m …` (entrypoint per coder_1_2) |

## Frontend (Jinja2, server-rendered)

| Setting | Value |
|---|----|
| Stack | FastAPI `Jinja2Templates` + `StaticFiles`; plain CSS + vanilla JS (ES modules) |
| Location | `src/web/` (see `paths-access.mdc` 5b) |
| Build step | none — no Node/npm/bundler |
| Approved dependency (Stage 4 kickoff) | `uv add jinja2` |
| Needs explicit user ✅ | any JS/CSS framework (htmx, Alpine, Tailwind…), CDN links, web fonts from external hosts, `djlint`, `playwright` |

| Purpose | Command |
|---|---|
| Run UI | same as «API + UI» above; open `http://127.0.0.1:8080/` |
| UI tests | `uv run pytest tests/web/ -v` |
| UI lint (Python side) | `uv run ruff check src/web/` |
| Template lint (only if approved) | `uv run djlint src/web/templates --lint` |
| Browser E2E (only if approved) | `uv run pytest tests/web/e2e/ -v` (Playwright; browsers cached project-locally) |

## Docker / Postgres

| Purpose | Command |
|---|---|
| Start DB | `docker compose up -d` |
| Status | `docker compose ps` |
| Stop DB | `docker compose down` |

`DATABASE_URL` for host app: `postgresql+psycopg://vine:vine@127.0.0.1:5432/vine` (see `.env.example`).

## Eval harness

| Purpose | Command |
|---|---|
| Run set 1 | `./data/owner_eval/1/participant_test.sh --images-dir ./data/owner_eval/1/queries --manifest ./data/owner_eval/1/queries.tsv --endpoint 'http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/eval/predict' --output ./data/owner_eval/1/predictions.jsonl` |
| Run set 2 | same paths under `data/owner_eval/2/` |
| Collect eval report | `uv run python scripts/collect_eval_report.py` (flags per coder_2b; needs decision log path) |

Requires Stage 2 `/v1/eval/predict`. Do not point scripts at `_migration/`. Stage 2A may `uv add openai --optional ml` (see `coder_2a_llm.md`).

**Constraints:**
1. Switching stacks (pip/poetry/pnpm) = edit tables above only; do not scatter alternate commands in domain rules.
